# Beggars (AutonomousBeggars): 4% of Crafter bots live in their capital, beg players and passing bots for coin and
# loot, sell what they are given, and never spend a copper of it. A player who asks ANYONE for gold or items (any
# channel, or a /beg) gets followed around the city and insulted until they leave it. Every coin and item is
# real: given by a player (drag it onto the beggar), given by a passing bot from its own purse, or a begged item sold
# at a merchant or listed on the Realm Exchange. {coin} is the amount, {hoard} the beggar's whole purse, {npc} the
# merchant whose corner it is. Real swear words are not in the corpus: they swear the way 2003 chat did. New writing.

# ---- beg: to a real player walking past ----------------------------------------------------------
@kind beggar
@topic beg
@who *
spare a copper, {player}? just one. i wont even spend it
{player}! {player}! alms for a poor {class}? anything helps
[spare|got] [a few|any|some] [coppers|coin|silver] [for a poor soul|for an old {class}|for the needy][?|, friend?|, {player}?]
[please|pls|plz] {player}, [anything|any coin|any loot] [helps|will do|at all][, even trash drops|, even a bone|]
a gift for the needy, {player}? [loot you dont want|coin you wont miss|that rusty thing in your pack]
[kind|noble|generous] {player_class}, [spare a coin|spare some silver|toss a copper] for [the needy|a poor crafter|old me]?
{player} i see that full pack. you dont need ALL of it
[alms|alms for the poor|coin for the poor][, {player}|][!|, please!|, anything!]
[hey|psst|oi] {player}, [got any|any] [vendor trash|junk loot|spare drops] [for me|you dont want][?| i wont judge]
my forge went cold, {player}. [one silver|a few coppers|a single gold] [gets it lit again|buys the coal|and its lit]
{player} you look rich. [rich people share|share the wealth|spread it around][. please|. its the law|]
just drag a coin onto me, {player}. [any coin|one copper|anything]. its easy. look how easy
{player}, the realm needs heroes. i need [silver|coppers|gold]. help us both
i used to adventure like you, {player}. [then the bog took my boots|then a troll took my purse|then i took up crafting]. spare a copper?
{player}! dont walk away! [i saw you loot that|i know you have coin|i can hear your pack jingling]
a {player_class}! [your kind always gives|your kind is generous|bless your kind]. spare [a coin|some silver]?
[spare any|any spare] [gems|bones|hides|cloth|loot][, {player}|]? [i turn junk into food|i can sell that|i make use of anything]
{player} [you dropped|you forgot|you owe] [a coin|a copper|your charity]. right here. in my hand
[for the love of the realm|by all the gods|have mercy], {player}, [a copper|a coin|anything]
honest work [is hard to find|dried up|left me] in {capital}, {player}. [spare a coin|help a soul out]?
{player}, every coin you give me makes the realm [stronger|richer|better]. probably
you got that much loot and none of it for me, {player}? [sad|tragic|a crime]
[good|fine|kind] {player}, [a moment|one moment|a second]. [a coin|a copper] [for a poor beggar|for my supper]?
[poor|old|hungry] {class} here, {player}. [anything helps|any coin helps|every copper counts]
dont make eye contact if you want, {player}, just make coin contact
{player} that armor looks expensive. you can afford one copper. ONE
i will [pray|sing|chant] for you, {player}. for a silver. for a copper i will hum
{player}! i accept [coin|loot|potions|anything that sells]. no refunds
[im not|not] asking for much, {player}. [just|only] [some coin|a silver|whatever you have]
[some|a little] [coin|silver] for [a poor|an honest|a humble] beggar, {player}? [the gods see you|i will remember you]
{player}, the guards dont give. the merchants dont give. [be better than them|you are my last hope|be the one]

# ---- beg_bot: to a passing bot (it may really give from its own purse) ------------------------------
@kind beggar
@topic beg_bot
@who *
{target}, [spare a copper|spare some coin|anything for me][?|, friend?]
[hey|oi|psst] {target}, [loot to spare|any coin to spare|got anything][?| for a poor soul?]
{target}! [i know you just sold|i saw you at the merchant|youre loaded]. share
[alms|coin][, {target}|] [for the needy|for an old {class}][?|!]
{target} [one coin|a copper] and i will [tell everyone you are kind|stop following you|bless your pulls]

