[come find me|im on my corner] in {capital}. [bring coin|bring loot|bring anything]
[what do you want|what]? [unless its coin|unless you are bringing coin|if its not coin], [im busy|go away|dont bother]
[busy|very busy]. begging [is a full time job|takes all day|doesnt do itself]. [coin?|unless you have coin]
[you whisper|you send tells] but [no coin|no silver|no gifts]? [typical|heh|tch]
[questions cost a copper|answers cost coin], {player}. [pay first|coin first]

